# Release binary archives (hosted on GitHub Releases, never tracked in Git tree)
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.7z

# Unpacked binary directories (only markdown docs and checksums are tracked)
**/win/
**/linux/
**/win-x64/
**/linux-x64/

# Whitelist markdown documentation, checksums, and metadata
!**/*.md
!**/SHA256SUMS.txt
!**/checksums.sha256
!**/LICENSE

# IDE / Build Artifacts
.vs/
.idea/
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

dist/
